Package: CLAreaSP
Type: Package
Title: Spatially Clustered Effects Area Level Models for Survey Data in Small Area Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Xin", "Wang", , "xwang14@sdsu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Spatially clustered area-level small area estimation under
    informative/survey sampling. Provides ADMM-based graph and
    minimum-spanning-tree fusion algorithms (with MCP penalties),
    Fay-Herriot and spatial (SAR) Fay-Herriot fitting, BIC model
    selection, and area-level predictors for clustered random effects.
License: GPL-3
